;;; PLAN.  zz-int-halves: k = max(k,0) - max(-k,0) with both halves in NN.  nv-zpow-def: NV-ZPOW(K, w, k) is in K
;;; and NV-ZPOW(K, w, k) w^b = w^a (IOTA, existence by an inverse of w^b, uniqueness by cancellation).
;;; nv-zpow-nat: w^k for k in NN is the ring power.  nv-zpow-neg: w^(-j) w^j = 1.  Existence (ccr-4-8) from the
;;; NN form nv-local-factorization (ccr2-nv); uniqueness from 4.7's uniqueness (nv-uniformizer-factorization-
;;; unique) after multiplying both sides by w^(b_k + b_l).
