;;; LOAD WINDOW: after ccr4x-vocab and ccr2-nv (nv-local-factorization, nv-uniformizer-factorization-unique,
;;; nv-pow-norm-power, nf-inverse, nv-unit-norm); ring-power laws (ring-power-add, ring-power-zero).
